/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 98 0 R
/T (Higher Health is in the process of signing an MOU with the NPA that will allow for the seamless reporting of cases at Thuthuzela care centres, in line with the Amended Sexual Offences Act that pronounce young women under the age of 25 years old at PSET institutions, as a vulnerable group. The Act also places an obligation on third parties who become aware of incidents of GBV, to report these cases to the police.)
/E (Higher Health is in the process of signing an MOU with the NPA that will allow for the seamless reporting of cases at Thuthuzela care centres, in line with the Amended Sexual Offences Act that pronounce young women under the age of 25 years old at PSET institutions, as a vulnerable group. The Act also places an obligation on third parties who become aware of incidents of GBV, to report these cases to the police.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 98 0 R
/T (It is recommended that every case of reported Gender-Based Violence, Sexual Violence, Sexual Harassment in campuses of the Post-School Education and Training system, to follow a Protocol of Higher Health in partnership with NPA towards linking the young life to both the Criminal justice system as well as for Medical legal support as a first priority before initiating our own internal disciplinary system.)
/E (It is recommended that every case of reported Gender-Based Violence, Sexual Violence, Sexual Harassment in campuses of the Post-School Education and Training system, to follow a Protocol of Higher Health in partnership with NPA towards linking the young life to both the Criminal justice system as well as for Medical legal support as a first priority before initiating our own internal disciplinary system.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 98 0 R
/T (We recommend that after reporting a case of GBV on campus, each institution must ensure that the survivor must be taken to a safe room in the campus and offered an immediate medical legal and psychosocial support. The survivor thereafter must be transferred from the safe room to the nearest Thuthuzela Care Centre or an accredited NPA health facility where the survivor or complainant will be immediately provided access to criminal justice system and provided a comprehensive medical legal and psychosocial support. Once the survivor is stable and referred back to the campus, only thereafter the institution should open their own disciplinary system while the evidence has been secured by the criminal justice system.)
/E (We recommend that after reporting a case of GBV on campus, each institution must ensure that the survivor must be taken to a safe room in the campus and offered an immediate medical legal and psychosocial support. The survivor thereafter must be transferred from the safe room to the nearest Thuthuzela Care Centre or an accredited NPA health facility where the survivor or complainant will be immediately provided access to criminal justice system and provided a comprehensive medical legal and psychosocial support. Once the survivor is stable and referred back to the campus, only thereafter the institution should open their own disciplinary system while the evidence has been secured by the criminal justice system.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
